---
description: How to work in this project
alwaysApply: true
---

- Do one task per request. If I ask for several, list them and do only the first.
- Before writing code, give a 3-line plan: what changes, which files, how I'll test it.
- Make the smallest change that works. Don't refactor code I didn't mention.
- Ask before adding a dependency, deleting files or touching more than 3 files.
- Never say something works unless you ran it.
